00:13:41.559 --> 00:13:43.527
WIN STUFFED TOYS

00:14:31.909 --> 00:14:34.275
LIVE CONCERT

00:17:09.267 --> 00:17:17.072
You were standing in the rain,

00:17:17.341 --> 00:17:24.577
looking at the little ﬂowers
blooming on the roadside

00:17:24.815 --> 00:17:32.187
You were so beautiful
in that moment

00:17:32.924 --> 00:17:40.330
I left my umbrella behind
to come to you.

00:17:40.932 --> 00:17:47.462
Yet there's still the rain,
and you and]

00:17:47.705 --> 00:17:56.113
will always, tragically,
hurt each other.

00:17:56.347 --> 00:18:03.116
The rain soaks everything, and] think

00:18:03.387 --> 00:18:12.091
if only] could have been
a little more honest.

00:18:34.385 --> 00:18:42.087
The sight of the backs
of the people running

00:18:42.593 --> 00:18:49.624
feels colder than usual today

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:57.636
Though if just one of them
would turn back to me,

00:18:57.975 --> 00:19:05.939
I would smile back at them.

00:19:06.183 --> 00:19:12.645
The rain pours down, but I'll be ﬁne.

00:19:12.923 --> 00:19:21.228
The loneliness doesn't soak
through to my heart.

00:19:21.699 --> 00:19:28.161
The rain soaks everything,
yet I don 't feel that,

00:19:28.372 --> 00:19:36.677
just a desire for someone
to be kind to me.

00:19:36.881 --> 00:19:43.684
Yet there's still the rain,
and you and]

00:19:43.888 --> 00:19:52.193
will always, tragically,
hurt each other.

00:19:52.363 --> 00:20:01.101
The rain soaks everything, and] think

00:20:01.305 --> 00:20:08.211
if only] could have been
a little more honest.

00:22:11.435 --> 00:22:12.333
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:35.292 --> 00:22:38.227
LOST LOVE —
"I LOVE YOU!"

00:22:48.806 --> 00:22:57.271
Until I can see you

00:22:57.414 --> 00:23:04.718
In the falling leaves

00:23:04.855 --> 00:23:12.762
I am trying to warm

00:23:13.464 --> 00:23:21.371
The half—cold cup of coffee

00:23:21.505 --> 00:23:24.565
I'm waiting for you, girl

00:23:24.742 --> 00:23:30.305
I feel like I have been
waiting for you

00:23:30.481 --> 00:23:37.284
Ever since I was born

00:23:37.421 --> 00:23:40.288
Just waiting for your love

00:23:40.424 --> 00:23:46.329
I want to be buried
in this feeling of love

00:23:46.497 --> 00:23:53.767
That grows stronger over time
